var e=`# The notepad

The **notepad** stores reusable snippets: \`#import\` modules, functions, etc.

Each note has a scope:
- **Global**: Available in all your projects.
- **Project**: Available only in the current project.

Open it via the ^sticky_note_2^ toolbar button or the **Edit** > **Open notepad** menu. Search a note with the search bar, then insert it at the editor cursor.`;export{e as default};